ACL Anthology — Python library 1.3.4 and metadata schema
------------------------------------------------------
Source: https://github.com/acl-org/acl-anthology
Revision: e9b28ecee27696ac39bf02882b4c552488cee8fe
Copyright 2019-2026 Marcel Bollmann <marcel@bollmann.me>
Copyright 2022 Matt Post <post@cs.jhu.edu>
License: Apache-2.0; full text in LICENSE-APACHE.

Includes adaptations of metadata parsing, navigation, person resolution,
citation-key generation, text conversion and citation export algorithms in
src/, together with data/schema.rnc and data/schema.json. The algorithms
were translated to Rust and adapted to immutable snapshots and explicit
error handling. The RNC schema is retained; schema.json is a derived
representation used by the Rust validator.


